#: ../../source/manage_data/02.5. historypanel.md:1
msgid "HistoryPanel（历史数据面板）"
msgstr "HistoryPanel"

#: ../../source/manage_data/02.5. historypanel.md:3
#, python-format
msgid ""
"本章介绍 **HistoryPanel**：在已理解 [DataType](02.%20datatypes.md) "
"的前提下，如何把多标的、多指标、同一时间轴上的历史数据收拢为一块「面板」，并在策略研究、回测准备与可视化之间复用。阅读本章无需先读 [本地数据源 "
"DataSource](3.%20datasource.md)，但若尚未向本地数据源填充数据，请先完成下载与配置后再使用 "
"`get_history_data` 取数。"
msgstr ""
"This chapter introduces **HistoryPanel**: On the premise of understanding "
"[DataType](02.%20datatypes.md), how to collect multi-target, multi-"
"indicator, and historical data on the same timeline into a \"panel\" and "
"reuse it between strategy research, backtest preparation and visualization. "
"There is no need to read [Local Data Source DataSource](3.%20datasource.md) "
"before reading this chapter, but if the local data source has not been "
"filled with data, please complete the download and configuration before "
"using `get_history_data` to get the data."

#: ../../source/manage_data/02.5. historypanel.md:7
msgid ""
"在上一章中，我们已经看到，`qteasy` 用 **DataType** "
"把「数据表里的原始列」抽象成策略与回测可以直接消费的**信息**。当这些信息需要在时间上与多只标的、多种数据类型（例如 OHLC、成交量、MACD "
"等）**对齐到同一套时间轴**上时，如果仍靠手工拼接多个 `DataFrame`，既容易出错，也不利于策略代码与可视化代码复用同一套数据结构。"
msgstr ""
"In the previous chapter, we saw that `qteasy` uses **DataType** to abstract "
"the \"raw columns in the data table\" into **information** that can be "
"directly consumed by the strategy and backtesting. When this information "
"needs to be **aligned** to the same timeline with multiple targets and "
"various data types (such as OHLC, volume, MACD, etc.), manually "
"concatenating multiple `DataFrames` is not only prone to errors, but also "
"hinders the reuse of the same data structure between the strategy code and "
"the visualization code."

#: ../../source/manage_data/02.5. historypanel.md:9
msgid ""
"**HistoryPanel（历史数据面板）** 正是为这一场景准备的容器：它在内部把数据组织为 **标的（shares）× 时间（index）× "
"数据类型（htypes）** 三维结构，让你可以用统一的接口做切片、筛选标的或指标，并在后续 **回测、策略逻辑或绘图** "
"中沿用同一份对象。对大多数用户来说，你并不需要关心面板在内部如何与本地数据源交互；通过熟悉的 **`get_history_data`** 等工作流拿到"
" `HistoryPanel` 之后，就可以把它当作「时间上对齐好的、可多标的、多指标的一块数据整体」来使用。"
msgstr ""
"**HistoryPanel** is a container designed for this scenario: internally, it "
"organizes data into a three-dimensional structure of **shares** × **index** "
"× **htypes**, allowing you to slice and filter shares or metrics using a "
"unified interface, and reuse the same object in subsequent backtesting, "
"strategy logic, or plotting. For most users, you don't need to worry about "
"how the panel interacts with the local data source internally; after "
"obtaining the **HistoryPanel** through familiar workflows such as "
"**`get_history_data`**, you can use it as a \"time-aligned, multi-shared, "
"multi-metric data set\"."

#: ../../source/manage_data/02.5. historypanel.md:11
#, python-format
msgid ""
"本章说明 HistoryPanel 的核心概念与常见用法；**下一章 [HistoryPanel "
"可视化](2.6.%20historypanel_visual.md)** 在此基础上介绍如何 **`hp.plot()`** "
"将同一块面板直接画成静态图或交互图。更底层的取数 API 分工，仅在 **[API 参考](../api/history_data.rst)** "
"中择要列出，以免与日常路径混淆。"
msgstr ""
"This chapter explains the core concepts and common uses of HistoryPanel; "
"**the next chapter, [HistoryPanel "
"Visualization](2.6.%20historypanel_visual.md)**, builds upon this to "
"introduce how to use **`hp.plot()`** to directly plot the same panel as a "
"static or interactive graph. The lower-level data retrieval API "
"functionalities are only briefly listed in **[API "
"Reference](../api/history_data.rst)** to avoid confusion with common paths."

#: ../../source/manage_data/02.5. historypanel.md:15
msgid "核心概念：三维结构与 `shape`"
msgstr "Core concepts: 3D structure and `shape`"

#: ../../source/manage_data/02.5. historypanel.md:17
msgid "HistoryPanel 在内存中对应一个三维 `numpy.ndarray`，三条轴依次为："
msgstr ""
"The HistoryPanel corresponds to a three-dimensional `numpy.ndarray` in "
"memory, with the three axes as follows:"

#: ../../source/manage_data/02.5. historypanel.md
msgid "轴"
msgstr "axis"

#: ../../source/manage_data/02.5. historypanel.md
msgid "含义"
msgstr "Meaning"

#: ../../source/manage_data/02.5. historypanel.md
msgid "常用属性"
msgstr "Common properties"

#: ../../source/manage_data/02.5. historypanel.md
msgid "第 0 维"
msgstr "0th dimension"

#: ../../source/manage_data/02.5. historypanel.md
msgid "标的（证券代码等）"
msgstr "Target (stock code, etc.)"

#: ../../source/manage_data/02.5. historypanel.md
msgid "`shares`、`level_count`"
msgstr "`shares`, `level_count`"

#: ../../source/manage_data/02.5. historypanel.md
msgid "第 1 维"
msgstr "1st dimension"

#: ../../source/manage_data/02.5. historypanel.md
msgid "时间（历史日期或时刻）"
msgstr "Time (historical date or moment)"

#: ../../source/manage_data/02.5. historypanel.md
msgid "`hdates`、`row_count`"
msgstr "`hdates`, `row_count`"

#: ../../source/manage_data/02.5. historypanel.md
msgid "第 2 维"
msgstr "2nd dimension"

#: ../../source/manage_data/02.5. historypanel.md
msgid "数据类型（如 `open`、`close`、`vol`）"
msgstr "Data types (such as `open`, `close`, `vol`)"

#: ../../source/manage_data/02.5. historypanel.md
msgid "`htypes`、`column_count`"
msgstr "`htypes`, `column_count`"

#: ../../source/manage_data/02.5. historypanel.md:25
msgid ""
"`shape` 返回 **`(标的数, 时间长度, 数据类型数)`**，与上面顺序一致。可以把它理解为：许多张「时间 × "
"指标」的二维表，在**标的**方向上再叠一层；同一面板内，各标的、各指标在时间上是对齐的。"
msgstr ""
"`shape` returns **(number of targets, time duration, number of data "
"types)**, in the same order as above. It can be understood as: many two-"
"dimensional tables of \"time × metric\" are stacked on top of each other in "
"the **target** direction; within the same panel, the targets and metrics are"
" aligned in time."

#: ../../source/manage_data/02.5. historypanel.md:27
msgid ""
"与单标的宽表 `DataFrame`（行是时间、列是指标）相比，HistoryPanel 把 **多标的** 明确放在第 0 "
"维，便于批量运算与按标的切片，而不必维护多层 `MultiIndex` 列。"
msgstr ""
"Compared to a single-index wide table `DataFrame` (rows are time, columns "
"are indices), HistoryPanel explicitly places **multi-index** in the 0th "
"dimension, which facilitates batch operations and index-based slicing, "
"without having to maintain multiple `MultiIndex` columns."

#: ../../source/manage_data/02.5. historypanel.md:29
msgid "*（示意图：可将「三维块」理解为 L 层标的 × R 行时间 × C 列指标；需要插图时可在后续版本补一张示意图。）*"
msgstr ""
"*(Illustrative diagram: The \"3D block\" can be understood as L layer index "
"× R row time × C column index; an illustration can be added in a later "
"version if needed.)*"

#: ../../source/manage_data/02.5. historypanel.md:31
msgid "如何获得 HistoryPanel"
msgstr "How to obtain HistoryPanel"

#: ../../source/manage_data/02.5. historypanel.md:33
msgid ""
"日常推荐路径是使用 **`qt.get_history_data(..., "
"as_data_frame=False)`**：在本地数据源已有所需数据的前提下，一次指定 `htype_names`（与 DataType "
"命名一致，参见上一章）与 `shares`、时间范围或 `rows`，即可得到对齐后的 `HistoryPanel`。"
msgstr ""
"The recommended approach is to use **`qt.get_history_data(..., "
"as_data_frame=False)`: assuming the required data is already available in "
"the local data source, you can obtain the aligned `HistoryPanel` by "
"specifying `htype_names` (consistent with the DataType naming, see the "
"previous chapter) along with `shares`, the time range, or `rows`."

#: ../../source/manage_data/02.5. historypanel.md:35
msgid ""
"默认情况下 `get_history_data` 的 `as_data_frame` 为 `True`，返回的是按标的分组的 **`dict[str, "
"DataFrame]`**，适合快速查看单标的；**需要三维面板时，务必传入 "
"`as_data_frame=False`**。完整参数、频率与复权等说明见 [历史数据 API](../api/history_data.rst)。"
msgstr ""
"By default, `get_history_data` sets `as_data_frame` to `True`, returning a "
"**`dict[str, DataFrame]`** grouped by index, suitable for quickly viewing "
"single-index data; **when a 3D panel is required, be sure to pass "
"`as_data_frame=False`.** For complete parameter, frequency, and weighting "
"information, please see [Historical Data API](../api/history_data.rst)."

#: ../../source/manage_data/02.5. historypanel.md:37
msgid ""
"下面示例**不依赖网络**，用小型数组构造面板，便于理解 `shape` 与标签；实际工作中可改用 `get_history_data` "
"从本地数据源填充。"
msgstr ""
"The example below **does not rely on the network** and uses a small array to"
" construct the panel, making it easy to understand the `shape` and labels; "
"in actual work, `get_history_data` can be used to populate it from a local "
"data source instead."

#: ../../source/manage_data/02.5. historypanel.md:63
msgid "若本地已有行情，可改为："
msgstr "If local market data is already available, it can be changed to:"

#: ../../source/manage_data/02.5. historypanel.md:77
msgid "基本操作：时间范围、标的与指标子集"
msgstr "Basic operations: time range, target and indicator subset"

#: ../../source/manage_data/02.5. historypanel.md:79
msgid "下列方法在**不改变取数语义**的前提下，缩小你当前关心的范围；返回值仍是 `HistoryPanel`（空面板除外）。"
msgstr ""
"The following methods narrow down your current focus without changing the "
"data retrieval semantics; the return value is still `HistoryPanel` (except "
"for empty panels)."

#: ../../source/manage_data/02.5. historypanel.md:81
msgid ""
"**推荐切片**：`subpanel(shares=..., htypes=..., hdates=...)`；时间轴亦可用 **`loc`** "
"或方括号索引 `hp[:, :, start:end]`。"
msgstr ""
"**Recommended slice**: `subpanel(shares=..., htypes=..., hdates=...)`; "
"timeline can also be used **`loc`** or square bracket index `hp[:, :, "
"start:end]`."

#: ../../source/manage_data/02.5. historypanel.md:82
msgid "**最近若干行**：`head(n)` / `tail(n)`。"
msgstr "**Recently recent lines: `head(n)` / `tail(n)`."

#: ../../source/manage_data/02.5. historypanel.md:83
msgid ""
"**兼容别名（已弃用）**：`segment` / `isegment` / `slice` 仍可用，但会发出英文 "
"`DeprecationWarning`；新代码请改用上列推荐 API（详见教程 [HistoryPanel 基础操作 "
"§4](../tutorials/2.4-historypanel-basics.md#4-切片与筛选缩小标的时间与指标范围)）。"
msgstr ""
"**Compatible aliases (deprecated)**: `segment` / `isegment` / `slice` are "
"still available, but English `DeprecationWarning` will be emitted; for new "
"codes, please use the recommended APIs listed above instead (see the "
"tutorial [HistoryPanel Basic Operations] for details "
"§4](../tutorials/2.4-historypanel-basics.md#4-Slicing and filtering to "
"narrow the target time and indicator range))."

#: ../../source/manage_data/02.5. historypanel.md:85
msgid ""
"单标的、多指标继续用 pandas 分析时，可用 **`to_share_frame(share)`** 得到该标的的 "
"`DataFrame`（时间为索引，列为 `htypes`）。多标的请优先 **`to_df_dict`**；整板 MultiIndex 请用 "
"**`to_multi_index_dataframe`**（兼容别名 `unstack` / `flatten` / "
"`flatten_to_dataframe` 仍可用）。详见 [HistoryPanel "
"API：导出](../api/HistoryPanel.rst) 与教程 [2.4 §7](../tutorials/2.4-historypanel-"
"basics.md#7-与-pandas-互转)。"
msgstr ""
"When you continue to use pandas to analyze a single target or multiple "
"indicators, you can use **`to_share_frame(share)`** to get the `DataFrame` "
"of the target (time is the index, and the column is `htypes`). For multi-"
"index, please give priority to **`to_df_dict`**; for the entire board "
"MultiIndex, please use **`to_multi_index_dataframe`** (compatible aliases "
"`unstack` / `flatten` / `flatten_to_dataframe` are still available). For "
"details, see [HistoryPanel API: Export](../api/HistoryPanel.rst) and "
"tutorial [2.4 §7](../tutorials/2.4-historypanel-basics.md#7-to-pandas-"
"interchange)."

#: ../../source/manage_data/02.5. historypanel.md:87
msgid ""
"`Operator` 与回测流程中，历史数据往往在策略运行调度阶段按组注入；具体参数与时间表配置见 **「创建并操作交易策略」** "
"相关章节。此处只需建立印象：**策略与可视化都可以围绕同一块 HistoryPanel（或其切片）展开**，从而减少「一份数据、多种形状」的重复整理。"
msgstr ""
"In the `Operator` and backtesting process, historical data is often injected"
" in groups during the strategy execution scheduling phase; specific "
"parameters and schedule configurations can be found in the relevant chapter "
"of **\"Creating and Operating Trading Strategies\"**. Here, it's sufficient "
"to establish the following: **Strategies and visualizations can both revolve"
" around the same HistoryPanel (or its slices)**, thereby reducing the "
"repetitive organization of \"one set of data in multiple formats\"."

#: ../../source/manage_data/02.5. historypanel.md:89
msgid "时序变换、缺失与列表达式（M2.2 CP-A）"
msgstr "Temporal Transformations, Missing and Column Expressions (M2.2 CP-A)"

#: ../../source/manage_data/02.5. historypanel.md:91
msgid "在切片与导出之外，HistoryPanel 还提供与 pandas 习惯接近的内核能力（CP-A 已交付）："
msgstr ""
"In addition to slicing and exporting, HistoryPanel also provides kernel "
"capabilities close to those used by pandas (CP-A has been delivered):"

#: ../../source/manage_data/02.5. historypanel.md:93
msgid "**时序变换**：`shift` / `diff` / `pct_change`（沿 `hdates`；返回新面板）"
msgstr ""
"**Timing Transformation**: `shift` / `diff` / `pct_change` (along `hdates`; "
"return to new panel)"

#: ../../source/manage_data/02.5. historypanel.md:94
msgid ""
"**缺失处理**：`bfill` / `dropna`；既有 `fillna` / `ffill` / `fillinf` 支持显式 "
"`inplace=`（默认 `True`，保持历史原地语义）"
msgstr ""
"**Missing handling**: `bfill` / `dropna`; existing `fillna` / `ffill` / "
"`fillinf` supports explicit `inplace=` (default `True`, maintaining "
"historical in-place semantics)"

#: ../../source/manage_data/02.5. historypanel.md:95
msgid "**列表达式**：`expr('hl2', '(high + low) / 2')`（仅 identifier 列名算术；默认新面板）"
msgstr ""
"**Column expression**: `expr('hl2', '(high + low) / 2')` (identifier column "
"name arithmetic only; default for new panels)"

#: ../../source/manage_data/02.5. historypanel.md:97
msgid ""
"可变性约定摘要：**旧填充方法默认原地**；本阶段新增 API（含 `bfill`、`shift` "
"族、`dropna`、`expr`）默认返回**新**对象。手把手示例见教程 [HistoryPanel "
"基础操作](../tutorials/2.4-historypanel-basics.md)（可变性表）与 "
"[时序变换与缺失处理](../tutorials/2.5-historypanel-data-analysis.md#时序变换与缺失处理shift--"
"diff--pct_change--dropna)；方法签名见 [HistoryPanel API](../api/HistoryPanel.rst)。"
msgstr ""
"Summary of variability convention: **Old filling methods default to in-"
"place**; new APIs in this stage (including `bfill`, `shift` families, "
"`dropna`, `expr`) return **new** objects by default. For step-by-step "
"examples, see the tutorial [HistoryPanel Basic "
"Operations](../tutorials/2.4-historypanel-basics.md) (variability table) and"
" [Timing Transformation and Missing "
"Processing](../tutorials/2.5-historypanel-data-analysis.md#Timing "
"Transformation and Missing Processing shift--diff--pct_change--dropna); for "
"the method signature, see [HistoryPanel API](../api/HistoryPanel.rst)."

#: ../../source/manage_data/02.5. historypanel.md:99
msgid "结构与统计（M2.2 CP-B）"
msgstr "Structure and Statistics (M2.2 CP-B)"

#: ../../source/manage_data/02.5. historypanel.md:101
msgid "在 CP-A 之外，CP-B 补齐结构操作与统计对称（均已交付）："
msgstr ""
"In addition to CP-A, CP-B completes structural operations and statistical "
"symmetry (both delivered):"

#: ../../source/manage_data/02.5. historypanel.md:103
msgid "**结构**：`drop` / `rename`（恒返回新面板；与原地整轴 `re_label` 并存）"
msgstr ""
"**Structure**: `drop` / `rename` (constantly returns to the new panel; "
"coexists with the original axis `re_label`)"

#: ../../source/manage_data/02.5. historypanel.md:104
msgid ""
"**统计**：`sum` / `median` / `var` / `quantile`（沿 `hdates` 聚合 → "
"`DataFrame`，契约对齐 `mean`）"
msgstr ""
"**Statistics**: `sum` / `median` / `var` / `quantile` (aggregated along "
"`hdates` → `DataFrame`, contract aligned with `mean`)"

#: ../../source/manage_data/02.5. historypanel.md:105
msgid ""
"**弃用**：`slice` / `segment` / `isegment` / `candle` 发出英文警告；推荐 `subpanel` / "
"`loc` / 索引切片 / `plot`"
msgstr ""
"**DEPRECATED**: `slice` / `segment` / `isegment` / `candle` Warn in English;"
" recommend `subpanel` / `loc` / index slicing / `plot`"

#: ../../source/manage_data/02.5. historypanel.md:107
msgid ""
"示例见教程 [drop / rename](../tutorials/2.4-historypanel-"
"basics.md#41-删除与重命名标签drop--rename) 与 [统计聚合补齐](../tutorials/2.5-historypanel-"
"data-analysis.md#统计聚合补齐sum--median--var--quantile)；签名见 [HistoryPanel "
"API](../api/HistoryPanel.rst)。"
msgstr ""
"For examples, see the tutorial [drop / "
"rename](../tutorials/2.4-historypanel-basics.md#41-Delete and rename tags "
"drop--rename) and [Statistical aggregation "
"completion](../tutorials/2.5-historypanel-data-analysis.md#Statistical "
"aggregation completion sum--median--var--quantile); for signatures, see "
"[HistoryPanel API](../api/HistoryPanel.rst)."

#: ../../source/manage_data/02.5. historypanel.md:109
msgid "因子研究与相关矩阵（M2.2 CP-D / CP-E）"
msgstr "Factor Study with Correlation Matrix (M2.2 CP-D/CP-E)"

#: ../../source/manage_data/02.5. historypanel.md:111
msgid ""
"**模块级研究**：`from qteasy.research import factor_ic, …`（截面 IC / 分位组合；**非** "
"Backtester；前瞻收益须自备）"
msgstr ""
"**Module Level Research**: `from qteasy.research import factor_ic, …` "
"(Sectional IC/quantile combination; **Non** Backtester; Forward-looking "
"returns must be prepared by yourself)"

#: ../../source/manage_data/02.5. historypanel.md:112
msgid "**面板时序矩阵**：`hp.corr(htype)` / `hp.cov(htype)`（shares×shares）"
msgstr ""
"**Panel Timing Matrix**: `hp.corr(htype)` / `hp.cov(htype)` (shares×shares)"

#: ../../source/manage_data/02.5. historypanel.md:113
msgid ""
"**导出推荐名**：`to_df_dict`、`to_multi_index_dataframe`（别名 `unstack` / `flatten*` "
"仍可用）"
msgstr ""
"**Export recommended names**: `to_df_dict`, `to_multi_index_dataframe` "
"(aliases `unstack` / `flatten*` are still available)"

#: ../../source/manage_data/02.5. historypanel.md:115
msgid ""
"手把手示例见教程 [截面 IC 与分位组合](../tutorials/2.5-historypanel-data-analysis.md#截面-ic-"
"与分位组合qteasyresearch) 与 "
"`examples/historypanel_research_factor_workflow.py`；API 见 "
"[research](../api/research.rst)。"
msgstr ""
"For step-by-step examples, see the tutorial [Cross-section IC and quantile "
"combination](../tutorials/2.5-historypanel-data-analysis.md# Section-ic-and "
"quantile combination qteasyresearch) and "
"`examples/historypanel_research_factor_workflow.py`; for the API, see "
"[research](../api/research.rst)."

#: ../../source/manage_data/02.5. historypanel.md:117
msgid "指标与列扩展（`kline` 等）"
msgstr "Metrics and column extensions (`kline`, etc.)"

#: ../../source/manage_data/02.5. historypanel.md:119
msgid ""
"在已有价格类 `htypes` 的基础上，可以通过 **`hp.kline`** "
"访问器调用均线、MACD、布林带等常见派生列。这类方法通常返回**新的** "
"`HistoryPanel`：在第三维上**追加**指标列，**不原地修改**原对象，`shares` 与 `hdates` 与原面板一致。复权列名（如"
" `close|b`）在较新版本中会与 `kline`、`returns` 等解析逻辑对齐；若面板中同时存在裸名与复权列，建议阅读 "
"[HistoryPanel API](../api/HistoryPanel.rst) 中的行为说明。"
msgstr ""
"Building upon the existing price class `htypes`, you can access common "
"derived columns such as moving averages, MACD, and Bollinger Bands via the "
"**`hp.kline`** accessor. These methods typically return a **new** "
"`HistoryPanel`: appending indicator columns to the third dimension, "
"**without modifying the original object**, and keeping `shares` and `hdates`"
" consistent with the original panel. Adjusted column names (such as "
"`close|b`) will be aligned with the parsing logic of `kline`, `returns`, "
"etc., in newer versions; if both raw and adjusted column names exist in the "
"panel, it is recommended to read the behavior description in the "
"[HistoryPanel API](../api/HistoryPanel.rst)."

#: ../../source/manage_data/02.5. historypanel.md:121
msgid ""
"更完整的因子式示例（收益、波动率、`apply_ta`、时序变换、统计聚合等）可与教程 **[使用 HistoryPanel "
"操作和分析历史数据](../tutorials/2.5-historypanel-data-analysis.md)** 对照阅读。"
msgstr ""
"More complete examples of factor-based methods (returns, volatility, "
"`apply_ta`, etc.) can be found in the tutorial **[Using HistoryPanel to "
"manipulate and analyze historical data](../tutorials/2.5-historypanel-data-"
"analysis.md)**."

#: ../../source/manage_data/02.5. historypanel.md:123
msgid "小结与下一步"
msgstr "Summary and Next Steps"

#: ../../source/manage_data/02.5. historypanel.md:125
msgid "HistoryPanel 提供 **`(标的 × 时间 × 数据类型)`** 统一容器，适合多标的、多指标且时间对齐的研究与回测准备。"
msgstr ""
"HistoryPanel provides a unified container of **(target × time × data "
"type)**, suitable for research and backtesting preparation with multiple "
"targets, multiple metrics, and time alignment."

#: ../../source/manage_data/02.5. historypanel.md:126
msgid ""
"日常用 **`get_history_data(..., as_data_frame=False)`** 获取面板；默认可先读上一章的 DataType"
" 命名与 `get_dtype_map()`。"
msgstr ""
"The `get_history_data(..., as_data_frame=False)` function is commonly used "
"to retrieve the data frame; by default, you can first read the previous "
"chapter on DataType naming and `get_dtype_map()`."

#: ../../source/manage_data/02.5. historypanel.md:127
msgid ""
"切片与子集：推荐 **`subpanel` / `loc` / `head` / `tail`**（旧名 "
"`slice`/`segment`/`isegment` 已弃用）；导出单标的：**`to_share_frame`**；时序/缺失/表达式见 CP-A"
" 小节，结构/统计见 CP-B 小节。"
msgstr ""
"Slices and subsets: recommended **`subpanel` / `loc` / `head` / `tail`** "
"(old name `slice`/`segment`/`isegment` deprecated); export single standard: "
"**`to_share_frame`**; see timing/missing/expression Subsection CP-A, see "
"subsection CP-B for structure/statistics."

#: ../../source/manage_data/02.5. historypanel.md:128
#, python-format
msgid ""
"**下一章 [HistoryPanel 可视化](2.6.%20historypanel_visual.md)**：使用 **`hp.plot()`**"
" 做静态或交互制图（请用 `plot`，勿依赖已弃用的 `candle`）。"
msgstr ""
"**Next chapter [HistoryPanel "
"Visualization](2.6.%20historypanel_visual.md)**: Use **`hp.plot()`** for "
"static or interactive drawing (please use `plot`, do not rely on the "
"deprecated `candle`)."

